class_name MtnProfiles
## 360-degree horizon skylines raycast from real DEM elevation data
## (Mapzen/Tilezen Terrarium tiles — public-domain SRTM + EU-DEM +
## national lidar sources, via the AWS open-data mirror). Each entry
## is one real panorama seen from a valley viewpoint:
##   fells      - Keswick, English Lake District (54.601,-3.134)
##   interlaken - Interlaken, Bernese Oberland (46.686,7.863)
##   banff      - Banff townsite, Canadian Rockies (51.178,-115.570)
##   chamonix   - Chamonix valley, Mont Blanc massif (45.920,6.870)
##   zermatt    - Zermatt valley, Matterhorn/Monte Rosa (46.021,7.749)
##   cortina    - Cortina d'Ampezzo, Dolomites (46.537,12.136)
##   grindelwald- Grindelwald, Eiger/Monch/Jungfrau (46.624,8.035)
## Values are tan(elevation angle) normalised 0..255 to the panorama's
## own maximum — apparent crest height = value/255 * max_tan * radius.

